duktape
------------------------------------------
Duktape is an embeddable Javascript engine, with a focus on portability and
compact footprint.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libduktape-devel-2.7.0-1bl2
  libduktape207-2.7.0-1bl2
  liblinenoise0-2.0-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.8-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  liblinenoise-devel-2.0-1bl2
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://duktape.org/

Canonical download:
  https://duktape.org/duktape-2.7.0.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack duktape-2.7.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./duktape-2.7.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/duktape-2.7.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/duktape-2.7.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libduktape207-2.7.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libduktape-devel-2.7.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(duktape)
  /usr/bin/duk.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/duktape.README
  /usr/share/doc/duktape/AUTHORS.rst
  /usr/share/doc/duktape/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/duktape/README.rst

(libduktape207)
  /usr/bin/cygduktape-207.dll

(libduktape-devel)
  /usr/include/duk_config.h
  /usr/include/duktape.h
  /usr/lib/libduktape.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/duktape.pc

------------------

